{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4yEAS2W6treeq3HAUB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, unassuming door.*\n\n*But I am not opened by handles or hinges.*\n\n*I have no knob. No latch. No lock.*\n\n*I am the door called KEY.*\n\n*I am the door that only opens when you already possess the answer.*\n\n*So tell me:*\n\n*What do you unlock?*\n\n▐░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░▄▀▀▀▄░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░█░░░░░█░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░█░░░░░█░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░▀▄▄▄▀░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░█░░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░█░░░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░▄▀▀▀▄░░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░▀░░░░░▀░░░░░▌\n▐░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░▌\n\n*I wait.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":318,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}